window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Bookworms, werewolves, and meddling matchmakers, oh my!</b></p> <p>When Gerri Wilder joins a book club, she has no idea she's about to become the ringleader of a matchmaking circus. Armed with romance novels and good intentions, these meddling ladies are determined to spark love between their stubborn offspring.</p> <p>Lena Caldwell is a 36-year-old video game designer who'd rather level up in life than swipe right. She's content with her controller... until she meets a muscular, hunky shifter who promises to give her the Big O she's only read about.</p> <p>Alex Mercer, wolf alpha and bookstore owner, is sick of his mother's not-so-subtle hints about finding a mate. Little does he know, fate and a bunch of interfering book club ladies have other plans. And when Alex meets snarky and funny Lena, he knows there's no turning back.</p> <p>When Lena becomes the target of a rival pack's claws, Alex must prove he's more than just a pretty face with a furry alter ego. How can he keep her safe without driving her away? And when will Lena realize that sometimes, reality is better than fiction?</p> <p><i>Get ready for a howling good time filled with steamy encounters, witty banter, and enough action to make your head spin faster than a wolf chasing his tail. This paranormal rom-com will have you laughing and cheering on these meddling mamas!</i></p>"; 
